                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Snakeez is a very creative spin on the nostalgic Snake game.\n\nAn egg randomly appears on the screen, and by eating it you'll become larger.\nYour goal is to become as large as possible and beat your high score.\nWhen you bump into your own body, it's game over.\nThis sounds way easier than it actually is!\n\nThis version runs smoothly, looks decent and is very challenging.\nThe physics are unique and different from any other snake game that I've ever played before.\nThe lowest high-score is only 57 at this moment and I got so close several times but I still haven't been able to beat it.\nI've made it my life mission to get on the scoreboard. \n\nIt's a decent game, but I must admit that I got a little bored after a while.",
